Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting bones,\Nwe'll reach it, we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so truly grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran into you on that day so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.74,0:00:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We laughed every moment\Nwith tears in our eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we knew we weren't alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The blowing wind came in\Nand joined us on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.22,0:00:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And with it I know we'll rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be flying up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.88,0:00:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why are you giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why you want to fight alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.74,0:00:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what kind of future\Ndo you think you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.88,0:01:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dream is already in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.28,0:01:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn off forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting\Nplans, we'll reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.54,0:01:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We are home from the horizon.\NOut on the edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.58,0:01:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is a place that\NI want to take you to?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.58,0:01:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head for it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But as for the way we already know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.28,0:01:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.36,0:01:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You scream by your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't break through the silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.32,0:01:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling defeated?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.90,0:01:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It crushes your helpless heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got your back. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.26,0:01:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put our fate within\Nthis light under the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.94,0:02:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you close your eyes and\Njust listen to my voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find the answer together. I'm\Ntelling you, in our path, I trust that it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.86,0:02:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,will lead us to another sea, untattered.\NCause now we are home on the horizon,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.52,0:02:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,out on the edge of the world There\Nis a place that I want to take
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.70,0:02:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You too, let's head forward then.\NBut after the way we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.16,0:02:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.36,0:02:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you multiplying and\Nmaking animal sounds at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.36,0:02:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell could have\Nhappened to you all?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.06,0:02:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, one of you's got to be real
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.10,0:02:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.02,0:02:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding! Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.48,0:02:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.40,0:02:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.88,0:02:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Untie me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.76,0:02:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's talking like\Nshe's really not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.76,0:02:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It is me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.30,0:03:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I was looking everywhere for you, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.16,0:03:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are, tying me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.52,0:03:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.82,0:03:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to admit, though,\Nthis is pretty bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.52,0:03:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She certainly does look like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.18,0:03:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't take much to realize\Nthey're fake, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.82,0:03:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What with the animal sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.12,0:03:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought you guys had multiplied\Nsomehow. Not possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.68,0:03:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,At least I don't think!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.08,0:03:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.06,0:03:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us what you know! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.02,0:03:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be hiding something from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.14,0:03:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been here the entire time, even when\Nthat woman assaulted my friends and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.10,0:03:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.78,0:03:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lie to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.40,0:03:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, someone was after you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.02,0:03:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, actually, it was you, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.08,0:03:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.44,0:04:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, technically, it was\Na fake you, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.08,0:04:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But we tried to escape\Nthe forest with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.36,0:04:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's confusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.04,0:04:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.95,0:04:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,all of a sudden, that phony Luffy turned\Ninto a gigantic woman, and she attacked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.62,0:04:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.18,0:04:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a scary tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.64,0:04:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The name's Barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.16,0:04:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Barrel?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.22,0:04:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A cute rabbit and a pretty girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.00,0:04:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What a charming little bunch you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.36,0:04:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,When I see such bright\Nand beautiful faces,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.78,0:04:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to dig in and scratch them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.26,0:04:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobie, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.44,0:04:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.98,0:04:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Squirming won't help you, little lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.78,0:04:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's probably lost in\Nthe forest somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.12,0:04:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Claim attacked!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.94,0:05:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you Tia okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.56,0:05:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.47,0:05:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I am now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.39,0:05:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.42,0:05:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you've done it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.54,0:05:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.62,0:05:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave this one to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.98,0:05:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A black claw! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.72,0:05:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now step aside, it's my turn here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.82,0:05:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Reflection!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.72,0:05:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.88,0:06:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.96,0:06:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Was Carrot's punch redirected\Nthrough the mirror just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.74,0:06:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't figured it out yet. I have\Nthe powers of the mirror-mirror-brute!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.24,0:06:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And just like a mirror reflects\Nany light that hits it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.36,0:06:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,if you throw a punch my way...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.68,0:06:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,As you saw, I'll send\Nit right back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.22,0:06:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get close! Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.24,0:06:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm going to break that stupid mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.10,0:06:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this, mirror world!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.24,0:07:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She disappeared. Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.72,0:07:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Who wants to join her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.44,0:07:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.78,0:07:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.36,0:07:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.98,0:07:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You better let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.54,0:07:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get too close, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.94,0:07:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late for that, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.82,0:07:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's already aware that you're all\Nhere, so there's no use hiding from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really think no\None noticed your arrival?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.54,0:07:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How hopelessly naive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.02,0:08:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You might as well give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.02,0:08:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama gave everyone direct orders\Nto go after you, intruders!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.20,0:08:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy and those ones,\Nthese fools, and even him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.68,0:08:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've all been given the\Nvery same set of commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.18,0:08:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to kill\Nthe Straw Hats, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.52,0:08:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but don't let them near Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.40,0:08:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I want them to regret the fact that\Nthey ever tried messing with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.56,0:08:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't outfox Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.62,0:08:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She knows all that happens in her land.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.78,0:08:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to work, homies!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.36,0:08:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let these dunces escape us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.70,0:09:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.10,0:09:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He got me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.54,0:09:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.38,0:09:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, just run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.32,0:09:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There are too many of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.26,0:09:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over if all three of us get caught!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.66,0:09:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget they work for Big Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.98,0:09:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We really shouldn't take this lightly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.68,0:09:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Go find Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.16,0:09:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold them off in the meantime!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.84,0:09:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.24,0:09:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.72,0:09:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's rumble!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.74,0:09:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster point!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.38,0:10:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, take a gander at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.40,0:10:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A talking reindeer is fancy enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.52,0:10:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but it looks like he's got\Neven more tricks up his sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.44,0:10:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama will be delighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.32,0:10:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She's interested in collecting\Nall creatures of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.50,0:10:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,especially exotic types like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.70,0:10:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wee! Wee! Wee!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.80,0:10:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now catch them for Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.84,0:10:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no use running, honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.50,0:10:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.56,0:10:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.58,0:10:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.90,0:10:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Alone, I kept looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.46,0:10:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and running around until\Ndarkness fell over the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.40,0:10:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.20,0:10:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're together now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.26,0:10:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All righty then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.96,0:10:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to rescue Chopper\Nand Nami from that lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.00,0:10:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.91,0:10:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.83,0:11:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything that happened\Nwas in this exact location.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.42,0:11:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But now no one's around anymore,\Nwhich is why I want answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.84,0:11:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.40,0:11:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Chopper go? And Carrot?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.80,0:11:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That creepy woman Barrel and all the weird
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.36,0:11:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,forest monsters didn't even mess with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.86,0:11:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That has to mean you're one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.50,0:11:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, am I with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.18,0:11:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm certainly not their enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.68,0:11:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my throat might get posh, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.24,0:11:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But maybe I'd talk if you got\Nme some juice from over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.36,0:11:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's apple juice all you ever think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.32,0:11:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you can tell us\Nsomething really good,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.60,0:11:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,then sure, we'll bring your dumb drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.74,0:11:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.65,0:11:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you keep talking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.16,0:11:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I kind of want some, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.26,0:11:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, you look pretty tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.28,0:11:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.16,0:11:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm strong as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.24,0:11:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What of it, weirdo?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.14,0:11:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.56,0:11:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Suppose you can't judge\Na book by its cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.04,0:12:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Your reindeer buddy really took me\Nby surprise with how powerful he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.82,0:12:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He's probably still busy with all those\Ntrees and flowers that attacked him, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.36,0:12:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's still standing, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.96,0:12:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they've been given orders,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.88,0:12:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,they're not gonna stop until\Nthey accomplish their mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.10,0:12:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.01,0:12:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if that's the case, then I have\Nto wonder why they stopped following me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.10,0:12:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.62,0:12:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, knocking them\Naround shuts them up, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.88,0:12:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But, uh, how can these\Ntree guys even move?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.22,0:12:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All of the residents here in Totoland\Nmust pay the equivalent of one
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.64,0:12:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,month's worth of their soul to the\Nkingdom in exchange for their safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.60,0:12:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This happens every six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.68,0:12:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a tax?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.76,0:12:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct, but they pay with their lifespan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.80,0:12:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Doing the math, the people lose\Ntwo months of their life each year,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.78,0:12:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and an entire year of their lives\Nevery six years that they live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.04,0:12:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.95,0:13:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lin-Lin, I mean, Big Mom has abilities\Nfrom consuming the soul soul fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.16,0:13:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She's able to manipulate\Nanyone's soul as she pleases.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.56,0:13:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and she uses that power\Nto take away little
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.10,0:13:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,chunks of lifespan from\Nher loyal subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.26,0:13:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They're faced with a difficult choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.08,0:13:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They can stay here in Toto\NLand for a price or leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.36,0:13:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,After gathering up everyone's souls,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.24,0:13:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,she spreads them throughout the kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.10,0:13:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and all sorts of things become animated\Nand take on a life of their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.58,0:13:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We lovingly call these whimsical\Nlittle creatures homies around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.68,0:13:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This collection and distribution of\Nlifespan is operated by Linlin's, oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.56,0:13:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, big mom's incarnations\Nthat are made up of her own soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.60,0:13:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and that is the true\Nnature of toto land we
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.20,0:13:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,noticed that a lot of\Nunusual things were alive
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.54,0:13:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,when we arrived here so\Ndoes that explain the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.04,0:13:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,talking crocodile and\Nhuman-like rabbit we saw
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.46,0:14:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah that's correct she\Ngives animals human souls
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.50,0:14:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,that's incredible that means\Nthem too actually that's a
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.52,0:14:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,whole different thing\NRoulette used her ability to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.76,0:14:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,turn normal animals into\Ndecoy people to throw you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.24,0:14:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, also, the souls can't be put\Ninto corpses or other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.04,0:14:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.80,0:14:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been watching this whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.60,0:14:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to get myself\Ninvolved, okay? Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.52,0:14:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a crappy answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.92,0:14:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you buried here anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.68,0:14:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what she said!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.10,0:14:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us who you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.64,0:14:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Say it, or else no juice for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.82,0:14:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll tell you everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.34,0:14:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.16,0:14:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.94,0:14:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A very long time ago, Big Mom and I were\Nonce, er, rather, Charlotte Lin-Lin and I
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.94,0:15:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,were once
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.22,0:15:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Were once married as\Nhusband and wife. Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.30,0:15:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, a sweet three general?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.56,0:15:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.18,0:15:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.76,0:15:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make you regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever-stepping foot on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.52,0:15:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So you and Big Mom were...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.90,0:15:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, a married couple?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.88,0:16:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We even had two daughters together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.58,0:16:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But sadly, after they were\Nborn, she broke it off with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.72,0:16:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's not like the homies\Nare my friends or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.94,0:16:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,More like I'm beneath their notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.38,0:16:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.08,0:16:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's giant! Who's this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.66,0:16:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on there, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.96,0:16:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What brings you to these woods?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.04,0:17:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a concern\Nwith my presence here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.28,0:17:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.42,0:17:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're always welcome in these parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.70,0:17:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.84,0:17:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.30,0:17:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.92,0:17:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.08,0:17:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.14,0:17:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.48,0:17:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's pulling him out of the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.40,0:17:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your back, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.98,0:17:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.62,0:17:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.12,0:17:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.03,0:17:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.82,0:17:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not a giant, his head's just big!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.30,0:17:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you gone mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.12,0:17:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You think we wouldn't notice that\Nyou're spilling info to the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.38,0:17:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You insufferable fool! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.84,0:18:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not be rash now, Cracker!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.94,0:18:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish to see my child!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.40,0:18:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Chiffon, even if it's only for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.86,0:18:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard she got married.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.90,0:18:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I only want to give her my blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.72,0:18:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Have mercy on this old soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.78,0:18:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can talk to Linlin,\Nwe can work something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.24,0:18:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I overheard a rumor that Lola ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.80,0:18:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.32,0:18:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I worry about my precious children.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.98,0:18:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.40,0:18:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She's your daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.16,0:18:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,One of my older sisters did the latter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.54,0:18:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She ran off to see a while\Nback in search of a husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.66,0:18:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Of her choosing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.70,0:18:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You said that she ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.64,0:18:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Rekker let go of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.56,0:18:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I only want to see my\Ndaughters is that so wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.24,0:18:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll never\Nask for anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.70,0:18:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.36,0:19:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She must be...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.16,0:19:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Lola.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.62,0:19:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize you went\Nto the New World already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.00,0:19:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't go there, you big silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.90,0:19:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We came from there in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.50,0:19:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My mama's a pirate just like me, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.10,0:19:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.90,0:19:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, you should take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.70,0:19:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my mama's Viva card.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.70,0:19:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A piece of paper? Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.90,0:19:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I hang on to that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.10,0:19:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the greatest pirates I've\Never met in my life was Lola's mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.92,0:19:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll come in handy someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.52,0:19:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just anybody gets one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.82,0:19:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything makes sense now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.88,0:19:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.62,0:19:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola told us that her mom was a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.98,0:19:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was Big Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.88,0:19:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.82,0:19:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy, he's Lola's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.24,0:20:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two are back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.70,0:20:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the bird and rabbit guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.28,0:20:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's flying now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.30,0:20:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Randolph, hold!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.08,0:20:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, was that Haki?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.24,0:20:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what else could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.18,0:21:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They all screamed in terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.92,0:21:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And then withered away?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.14,0:21:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Randolf
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.98,0:21:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Interrupting my entrance\Nand getting in the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.20,0:21:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,way you must think you're\Na real big shot now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.20,0:21:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Randolph?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.24,0:21:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies. It was his idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.42,0:21:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a blatant lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.70,0:21:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.08,0:21:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They can talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.84,0:21:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.58,0:22:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,They're acting like he\Nholds a high position.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.88,0:22:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's strong, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.22,0:22:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that Mama always likes\Nto stay ahead of the curve,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.82,0:22:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,considering Straw Hat Luffy was\Nthe man who beat Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.82,0:22:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She assumed Barrel would have a hard time,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.42,0:22:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So she sent me. Did my ears hear\Nthat correctly, brother dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.04,0:22:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She's back, huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.08,0:22:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If she had ordered me to kill\Nthem, I would have off them by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.80,0:22:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.60,0:22:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We, the Seducing Wood's team,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.16,0:22:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,would have never allowed\Na single assigned target!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.78,0:22:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,to leave this forest alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.30,0:22:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Golly!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.21,0:23:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did Barrel and Cranker\Nshow up here, but King Palme, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.42,0:23:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.33,0:23:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe they're all\Nin the woods at the same time!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.50,0:23:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just dandy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.02,0:23:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But we have little time for your games.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.62,0:23:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,By tomorrow at noon,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.40,0:23:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the Vinsmoke siblings will be\Narriving at the Whole Cake Shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.56,0:23:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,making time a precious commodity.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.82,0:23:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Forming a family connection\Nwith the Vinsmooks has been
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.06,0:23:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,a long-awaited goal that\NMama's been working towards.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.20,0:23:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll finally obtain Germa Double Six's\Nmilitary might and scientific expertise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.36,0:23:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I realize that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.78,0:23:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He turned into animals!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.54,0:23:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.94,0:24:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How can that tree talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.84,0:24:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.76,0:24:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, can a tree do this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.80,0:24:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.54,0:24:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, come and send us free!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.44,0:24:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,She caught Chopper, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.28,0:24:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened, you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.94,0:24:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you get in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.56,0:24:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She trapped us both in this mirror world.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.26,0:24:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,She can use a tricky\Nability, so be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.18,0:24:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like that, Brother Cracker?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.46,0:24:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got these fools\Nright where I want them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.34,0:24:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,By the scruff of their neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.62,0:24:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.32,0:24:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.94,0:24:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.96,0:24:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't hurt us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.34,0:25:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It was only the mirror that broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.96,0:25:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing bad happened to us\Nhere in the mirror world.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.50,0:25:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.02,0:25:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it, but\Nthat's good news at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.96,0:25:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.08,0:25:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wasting time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.96,0:25:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,First off, I'd better deal\Nwith this loose-lipped fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.56,0:25:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.12,0:25:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.76,0:25:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She said that I'm to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.02,0:25:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you reconsider, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.42,0:25:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We can still talk this through, Gregor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.90,0:25:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, I'm your stepdaughter after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.76,0:25:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,In the past, yes, but not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.14,0:25:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama herself considers her 43\Nex-husbands practically strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.44,0:25:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,To us, you're no longer\Nfamily and no longer blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.64,0:25:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how can you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.62,0:25:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Telling me I'm no longer\Nrelated to my own daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.48,0:25:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hardly bear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.28,0:25:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise, no funny business.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.36,0:25:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I only want to give\Nthem my blessing, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.96,0:26:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.02,0:26:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.44,0:26:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that sympathy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.18,0:26:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,When you run into someone again\Nand again, you get attached!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.54,0:26:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.64,0:26:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.22,0:27:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is about to get ugly!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.96,0:27:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,General Cracker's gonna stop that guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.74,0:27:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And maybe ask while he's at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.84,0:27:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Omasa, seize them so we can make\Nsure the job gets done right!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.64,0:27:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We should run!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.72,0:27:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not safe here!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.16,0:27:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.24,0:27:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You can leave the tower, Splay!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.64,0:27:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.18,0:27:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your name, by the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.94,0:27:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You can just call me Bound!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.32,0:27:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,About earlier, it sounded\Nlike you know Lola.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.50,0:27:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I do, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.08,0:27:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.02,0:27:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.60,0:28:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.28,0:28:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a present from my buddy Lola.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.04,0:28:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A piece of her mother's\Nbeaver card, or so she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.10,0:28:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.01,0:28:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume that's Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.52,0:28:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.92,0:28:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What's come over, all of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.04,0:28:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even you, King Baum?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.76,0:28:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.62,0:28:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.10,0:28:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, mule.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.06,0:28:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Homies can't disoccupy her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.20,0:28:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's tree, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.20,0:28:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.78,0:28:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The sense mama's soul\Nand can't shrug it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.26,0:28:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be Big Mom's Beavers card.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.96,0:28:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a hunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.08,0:28:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.44,0:29:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.18,0:29:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.78,0:29:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.16,0:29:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He's headed this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.78,0:29:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He grew worms? Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.18,0:29:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.28,0:29:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the Biscuit Knight Cracker, one\Nof Big Mom's Sweet Three Generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.26,0:29:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall learn to respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.78,0:29:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thousand-armed cracker, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.32,0:29:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,By simply tapping like so,\NI can grow another arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.02,0:29:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Tap twice and I get three.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.34,0:29:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you get the picture. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.40,0:29:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,However, that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.36,0:30:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.40,0:30:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Legs, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.78,0:30:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't even beat me\Nin your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.40,0:30:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You fools will not interfere\Nwith Mama's tea party.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.66,0:30:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Extra limbs won't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.56,0:30:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, second gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.14,0:30:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hulk bust us all the arms you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.22,0:30:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come, get bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.38,0:30:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.76,0:30:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come, Hulk whip.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.26,0:30:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you can't turn\Nthis into an Alto fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.52,0:30:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.34,0:30:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find Sanji so we can\Nleave this demented place.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.60,0:30:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything I do is all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.76,0:30:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but it's the only way I know.
